@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### Iniciar sesión como administrador
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###

### Desactivar un servicio sin eliminarlo físicamente
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/servicios-mascota/1/deactivate
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

###

### Eliminar físicamente un servicio
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/servicios-mascota/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
